[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2584772\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL - R.R.</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and the nuts (1b) and remove the rear wheel arch (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003496.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the wheel arch in its housing and secure it using the nuts and bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584772\">Op. 4450B06 LEFT REAR WHEEL - R.R.</a></p>"]]